e":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"北平王","official_note":"北平王是唐朝封给契丹首领李過折的王爵，用于安抚和羁縻边疆民族，此处表示朝廷授予其爵位以加强控制。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"制以過折爲北平王","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b563d787-3f8d-4f9e-8f40-1a99cef06703"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"檢校松漠州都督","official_note":"檢校松漠州都督是唐朝授予契丹首领的官职，檢校表示代理或加衔，松漠州都督负责管理松漠地区，此处用于加强李過折的地方权威。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"檢校松漠州都督","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"322753d1-0b71-4adc-b624-af18e25d2aa5"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":735,"link_td_description":"李过折，又作遇折、郁捷、李遇折，唐代契丹部落联盟首领。","link_td_id":"Q10010454","link_td_number_id":1054849,"people_name":"李過折","people_name_jianti_auto":"李过折","people_xingming":"李过折","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfec2-db0e-11ef-af88-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":735,"link_td_description":"李过折，又作遇折、郁捷、李遇折，唐代契丹部落联盟首领。","link_td_id":"Q10010454","link_td_number_id":1054849,"people_name":"過折","people_name_jianti_auto":"过折","people_xingming":"李过折","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfec3-db0e-11ef-ad95-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":735,"link_td_description":"李过折，又作遇折、郁捷、李遇折，唐代契丹部落联盟首领。","link_td_id":"Q10010454","link_td_number_id":1054849,"people_name":"北平王","people_name_jianti_auto":"北平王","people_xingming":"李过折","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfec4-db0e-11ef-ab5f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"契丹","place_name_jianti_auto":"契丹","place_note":"辽河上游","resolved_place_entity_id":89,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfec5-db0e-11ef-a296-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"松漠州","place_name_jianti_auto":"松漠州","place_note":"羁縻军区•总部设内蒙古巴林右旗","resolved_place_entity_id":7456,"start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfec6-db0e-11ef-a0ae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"唐攻契丹之战","tongjian_id":"war_N1001"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交","人事"],"content":"1春，正月，契丹知兵馬中郞李過折來獻捷；制以過折爲北平王，檢校松漠州都督。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，契丹知兵马中郎李过折来朝进献战利品及俘虏；皇上下制封李过折为北平王、检校松漠州都督。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，契丹知兵马中郞李过折来献捷；制以过折为北平王，检校松漠州都督。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21545,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfeb7-db0e-11ef-9d19-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"杜佑","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜佑","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfec9-db0e-11ef-bb0a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"杜佑曰：是年親耕，有司進儀注：天子三推，公卿九推，庶人終畝。帝欲重耕藉，遂進耕五十餘步，盡隴乃止。推，吐雷翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"杜佑曰：是年亲耕，有司进仪注：天子三推，公卿九推，庶人终亩。帝欲重耕藉，遂进耕五十余步，尽陇乃止。推，吐雷翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfec8-db0e-11ef-9a08-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"都城","place_name_jianti_auto":"都城","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfecb-db0e-11ef-83f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都城","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都城","place_note":"洛阳","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfecc-db0e-11ef-91f1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"都城，謂東都城。酺，音蒲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"都城，谓东都城。酺，音蒲。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfeca-db0e-11ef-a3af-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"都城","place_name_jianti_auto":"都城","resolved_place_entity_id":5371,"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfecd-db0e-11ef-a6e6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"乙亥，上耕藉田，九推乃止；公卿以下皆終畝。赦天下，都城酺三日。","content_fanyi":"正月十八日乙亥，玄宗亲耕藉田，九次推耜才停下；公卿以下官员都耕完一陇田地。大赦天下，都城中欢聚宴饮三天。","content_jianti_auto":"乙亥，上耕藉田，九推乃止；公卿以下皆终亩。赦天下，都城酺三日。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21546,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfec7-db0e-11ef-bc3e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfed1-db0e-11ef-925f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfed2-db0e-11ef-876a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"唐赤縣丞從七品。理，治也；唐諱「治」，改曰「理」。","note_content_jianti_auto":"唐赤县丞从七品。理，治也；唐讳「治」，改曰「理」。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfed0-db0e-11ef-863f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"河南丞","official_note":"河南丞是唐代河南府的佐官，负责协助府尹处理政务，此处指严安之担任此职，因其治理严厉而被高力士推荐来维持宴会秩序。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"河南丞嚴安之","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"071a771d-3403-42ba-8b3e-1f59dfd4f9f9"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":689,"link_death_year":762,"link_td_description":"高力士，本名冯元一，是唐朝的著名宦官。","link_td_id":"Q10005158","link_td_number_id":59019,"people_name":"高力士","people_name_jianti_auto":"高力士","people_xingming":"高力士","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfed4-db0e-11ef-bc7d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"严安之，唐朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10022677","link_td_number_id":7924245,"people_name":"嚴安之","people_name_jianti_auto":"严安之","people_xingming":"严安之","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfed5-db0e-11ef-9552-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"严安之，唐朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10022677","link_td_number_id":7924245,"people_name":"安之","people_name_jianti_auto":"安之","people_xingming":"严安之","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfed7-db0e-11ef-b249-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"五鳳樓","place_name_jianti_auto":"五凤楼","resolved_place_entity_id":5789,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfed3-db0e-11ef-bf4f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河南","place_name_jianti_auto":"河南","resolved_place_entity_id":176,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfed6-db0e-11ef-be30-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"上御五鳳樓酺宴，觀者諠隘，樂不得奏，金吾白梃如雨，不能遏；上患之。高力士奏河南丞嚴安之爲理嚴，爲人所畏，請使止之；上從之。安之至，以手板繞場畫地曰：「犯此者死！」於是盡三日，人指其畫以相戒，無敢犯者。","content_fanyi":"唐玄宗驾临五凤楼，诏赐臣民聚饮，观看的人喧闹拥挤，音乐无法演奏，金吾卫的白色梃杖挥动如雨，仍不能遏止人群；玄宗为此忧虑。高力士上奏说，河南县丞严安之维护治安十分严厉，人们都畏惧他，请求派他来制止混乱；玄宗同意了。严安之到后，用手板绕着场地画出一条线，说道：“越过此线者处死！”于是整整三天，人们指着那条线互相告诫，没有人敢越过。","content_jianti_auto":"上御五凤楼酺宴，观者諠隘，乐不得奏，金吾白梃如雨，不能遏；上患之。高力士奏河南丞严安之为理严，为人所畏，请使止之；上从之。安之至，以手板绕场画地曰：「犯此者死！」于是尽三日，人指其画以相戒，无敢犯者。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21547,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfece-db0e-11ef-ac6a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"丘氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘氏","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfedb-db0e-11ef-a90c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"詩·大東曰：睆彼牽牛，不以服箱。註云：服，牝服也。箱，大車之箱也。疏云：兩較之間謂之箱。甫田云：乃求萬斯箱。書傳云：長幾充箱。是車內容物之處。丘氏曰：服箱，猶言駕車也。衣，於旣翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"诗·大东曰：睆彼牵牛，不以服箱。注云：服，牝服也。箱，大车之箱也。疏云：两较之间谓之箱。甫田云：乃求万斯箱。书传云：长几充箱。是车内容物之处。丘氏曰：服箱，犹言驾车也。衣，于既翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfeda-db0e-11ef-912d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孔甲","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔甲","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfee2-db0e-11ef-b175-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"豢龍氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"豢龙氏","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfee3-db0e-11ef-a42d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉累","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘累","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfee4-db0e-11ef-9921-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"德秀","people_name_jianti_auto":"德秀","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfee5-db0e-11ef-9fb9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魯山","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁山","place_note":"河南鲁山县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfee6-db0e-11ef-9538-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁县","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfee7-db0e-11ef-8ded-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夏","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfee8-db0e-11ef-ac5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfee9-db0e-11ef-a629-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁阳县","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfeea-db0e-11ef-839b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南阳郡","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfeeb-db0e-11ef-8770-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfeec-db0e-11ef-825f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁阳郡","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfeed-db0e-11ef-a839-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfeee-db0e-11ef-9fa5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁县","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfeef-db0e-11ef-b263-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝州","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfef0-db0e-11ef-a30c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfef1-db0e-11ef-a4bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯山縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁山县","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfef2-db0e-11ef-a64b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯山","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁山","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfef3-db0e-11ef-9edf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魯山，古魯縣，夏孔甲時，豢龍氏劉累所遷之地。漢爲魯陽縣，屬南陽郡，後魏置魯陽郡，隋復爲魯縣，屬汝州。唐爲魯山縣，以縣有魯山，故名。于蔿者，德秀所爲歌也。蔿，韋委翻。考異曰：明皇雜錄作「于蔿」，新傳作「于蔿于」。未詳其義。今從雜錄。","note_content_jianti_auto":"鲁山，古鲁县，夏孔甲时，豢龙氏刘累所迁之地。汉为鲁阳县，属南阳郡，后魏置鲁阳郡，隋复为鲁县，属汝州。唐为鲁山县，以县有鲁山，故名。于𫇭者，德秀所为歌也。𫇭，韦委翻。考异曰：明皇杂录作「于𫇭」，新传作「于𫇭于」。未详其义。今从杂录。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfee1-db0e-11ef-871f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"散官，無職事。散，蘇旱翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"散官，无职事。散，苏旱翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfef9-db0e-11ef-b371-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"刺史","official_note":"刺史是唐代州級行政長官，負責地方治理和軍事，此處指懷州刺史等參與音樂競賽，顯示其職責包括地方文化活動。","official_rank":"正四品下至從三品（唐代州級長官）","source_snippet":"時命三百里內刺史、縣令各帥所部音樂集於樓下","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"111eef51-0b4d-41a8-bc2c-33d097b76173"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"縣令","official_note":"縣令是唐代縣級行政長官，管理地方事務，此處指魯山令元德秀等參與音樂競賽，反映其職責包括地方文化活動。","official_rank":"從六品上至正七品下（唐代縣級長官）","source_snippet":"時命三百里內刺史、縣令各帥所部音樂集於樓下","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"44ad3ac2-5e37-47e2-82d8-d3c20fc10fde"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"懷州刺史","official_note":"懷州刺史是特定州的長官，此處因奢侈行為被皇帝批評，後被貶為散官，顯示其職責包括地方治理和文化活動。","official_rank":"正四品下至從三品（唐代州級長官）","source_snippet":"懷州刺史以車載樂工數百","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8b66cef4-7797-4655-a246-018680605b4d"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"魯山令","official_note":"魯山令是特定縣的長官，此處元德秀簡樸行事，與懷州刺史形成對比，反映其職責包括地方文化活動。","official_rank":"從六品上至正七品下（唐代縣級長官）","source_snippet":"魯山令元德秀惟遣樂工數人","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"b70a9167-d1f3-431b-979b-91db26f0dc6d"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"官制","official_name":"散官","official_note":"散官是唐代表示品階的官職，無實權，此處懷州刺史被貶為散官，表示失去實職，僅保留品階。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"立以刺史爲散官","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"38af5aba-a376-4afa-96c6-7d1d8320efb0"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":695,"link_death_year":754,"link_td_description":"元德秀，字紫芝，河南府人，魏明元帝拓跋嗣九代孙，唐朝官员、诗人。","link_td_id":"Q10021195","link_td_number_id":7109021,"people_name":"元德秀","people_name_jianti_auto":"元德秀","people_xingming":"元德秀","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfefb-db0e-11ef-9184-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":695,"link_death_year":754,"link_td_description":"元德秀，字紫芝，河南府人，魏明元帝拓跋嗣九代孙，唐朝官员、诗人。","link_td_id":"Q10021195","link_td_number_id":7109021,"people_name":"德秀","people_name_jianti_auto":"德秀","people_xingming":"元德秀","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfeff-db0e-11ef-8dd8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"懷州","place_name_jianti_auto":"怀州","place_note":"河南沁阳","resolved_place_entity_id":551,"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfefa-db0e-11ef-9373-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯山","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁山","place_note":"河南鲁山县","resolved_place_entity_id":1421,"start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfefc-db0e-11ef-b7fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"懷州","place_name_jianti_auto":"怀州","place_note":"河南沁阳","resolved_place_entity_id":551,"start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfefe-db0e-11ef-b244-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"時命三百里內刺史、縣令各帥所部音樂集於樓下，各較勝負。懷州刺史以車載樂工數百，皆衣文繡，服箱之牛皆爲虎豹犀象之狀。魯山令元德秀惟遣樂工數人，連袂歌于蔿。上曰：「懷州之人，其塗炭乎！」立以刺史爲散官。德秀性介潔質樸，士大夫皆服其高。","content_fanyi":"当时，命令三百里以内的刺史、县令各自率领所属乐队会集到五凤楼下，相互较量胜负。怀州刺史用车子载来数百名乐工，乐工们都穿着绣有彩色花纹的丝绸衣服，驾车的牛则都被装扮成老虎、豹子、犀牛和大象的样子。鲁山县令元德秀只派出几名乐工，手拉着手同唱《于蔿》歌。玄宗说：“怀州的人民，恐怕生灵涂炭了吧！”随即将怀州刺史调任为无职事的散官。元德秀性格耿介高洁、质朴无华，士大夫都钦佩他的高风亮节。","content_jianti_auto":"时命三百里内刺史、县令各帅所部音乐集于楼下，各较胜负。怀州刺史以车载乐工数百，皆衣文绣，服箱之牛皆为虎豹犀象之状。鲁山令元德秀惟遣乐工数人，连袂歌于𫇭。上曰：「怀州之人，其涂炭乎！」立以刺史为散官。德秀性介洁质朴，士大夫皆服其高。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21548,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"bd0cfed8-db0e-11ef-a2db-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孔子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔子","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"bd0f485d-db0e-11ef-a38b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳記孔子之言。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传记孔子之言。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"bd0f485c-db0e-11ef-a008-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"奚","place_name_jianti_auto":"奚","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4860-db0e-11ef-9623-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"厥","place_name_jianti_auto":"厥","place_note":"瀚海沙漠群","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4861-db0e-11ef-85e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"奚","place_name_jianti_auto":"奚","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4862-db0e-11ef-bd53-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"突厥","place_name_jianti_auto":"突厥","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4863-db0e-11ef-98b6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"奚、厥，謂奚與突厥。厥，九勿翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"奚、厥，谓奚与突厥。厥，九勿翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"bd0f485f-db0e-11ef-a5c3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"宰相","official_note":"宰相是唐代最高行政长官，负责辅佐皇帝处理国家政务，此处张九龄谏言反对以宰相作为赏功之官，强调其代天理物的职能。","official_rank":"正一品至正三品","source_snippet":"欲以爲相，張九齡諫曰：「宰相者，代天理物，非賞功之官也。」","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"88a05927-f6db-4f27-bcc6-826e0d4ea2e1"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"右羽林大將軍","official_note":"右羽林大将军是唐代禁军羽林军的高级将领，负责宫廷守卫和军事指挥，此处张守珪因功被授予此职，作为赏赐。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"拜右羽林大將軍","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"ec3c9ab7-7d39-480f-b459-096234257319"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"御史大夫","official_note":"御史大夫是唐代最高监察官员，负责弹劾百官和监督政务，此处张守珪兼任此职，可能表示其受信任并赋予监察权。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"兼御史大夫","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"4f7d5cde-8aa0-478f-98d1-d87a1c50a051"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":684,"link_death_year":740,"link_td_description":"张守珪，字元宝，陕州河北人（今山西省平陆）人，唐朝将领。","link_td_id":"Q10002401","link_td_number_id":951279,"people_name":"張守珪","people_name_jianti_auto":"张守珪","people_xingming":"张守珪","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4865-db0e-11ef-bf1d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":678,"link_death_year":740,"link_td_description":"张九龄，字子寿，一名博物，韶州曲江人（今广东省韶关市曲江区）。唐代第一位由岭南书生进身的宰相、诗人。卒谥文献。人称“张曲江”。有《张曲江集》。","link_td_id":"Q10002171","link_td_number_id":72688,"people_name":"張九齡","people_name_jianti_auto":"张九龄","people_xingming":"张九龄","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4866-db0e-11ef-9d48-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":684,"link_death_year":740,"link_td_description":"张守珪，字元宝，陕州河北人（今山西省平陆）人，唐朝将领。","link_td_id":"Q10002401","link_td_number_id":951279,"people_name":"守珪","people_name_jianti_auto":"守珪","people_xingming":"张守珪","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4867-db0e-11ef-a215-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":684,"link_death_year":740,"link_td_description":"张守珪，字元宝，陕州河北人（今山西省平陆）人，唐朝将领。","link_td_id":"Q10002401","link_td_number_id":951279,"people_name":"守珪","people_name_jianti_auto":"守珪","people_xingming":"张守珪","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"bd0f486b-db0e-11ef-8a8d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"契丹","place_name_jianti_auto":"契丹","resolved_place_entity_id":89,"start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4868-db0e-11ef-a86e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"奚","place_name_jianti_auto":"奚","place_note":"滦河上游","resolved_place_entity_id":401,"start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4869-db0e-11ef-8fe7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"厥","place_name_jianti_auto":"厥","place_note":"瀚海沙漠群","resolved_place_entity_id":118,"start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"bd0f486a-db0e-11ef-be7d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","resolved_place_entity_id":54,"start_index":121,"tongjian_id":"bd0f486c-db0e-11ef-81ec-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"唐攻契丹之战","tongjian_id":"war_N1001"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","权争"],"content":"2上美張守珪之功，欲以爲相，張九齡諫曰：「宰相者，代天理物，非賞功之官也。」上曰：「假以其名而不使任其職，可乎！」對曰：「不可。惟名與器不可以假人，君之所司也。且守珪纔破契丹，陛下卽以爲宰相；若盡滅奚、厥，將以何官賞之？」上乃止。二月，守珪詣東都獻捷，拜右羽林大將軍，兼御史大夫，賜二子官，賞賚甚厚。","content_fanyi":"唐玄宗赞赏张守珪的功劳，想任命他为宰相。张九龄劝谏说：“宰相是代替天子治理天下的，不是用来赏赐功臣的官职。”玄宗说：“给他宰相的名号而不让他担任实职，可以吗？”张九龄回答说：“不行。名位和职权不能假借给人，这是国君亲自掌管的。况且张守珪刚刚打败契丹，陛下就用他为宰相；如果全部消灭奚、突厥，又用什么官职来赏赐他呢？”玄宗这才作罢。二月，张守珪到东都进献战利品及俘虏，被任命为右羽林大将军，兼任御史大夫，赐给他的两个儿子官职，赏赐十分丰厚。","content_jianti_auto":"2上美张守珪之功，欲以为相，张九龄谏曰：「宰相者，代天理物，非赏功之官也。」上曰：「假以其名而不使任其职，可乎！」对曰：「不可。惟名与器不可以假人，君之所司也。且守珪才破契丹，陛下即以为宰相；若尽灭奚、厥，将以何官赏之？」上乃止。二月，守珪诣东都献捷，拜右羽林大将军，兼御史大夫，赐二子官，赏赉甚厚。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21549,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"ton