nk_death_year":740,"link_td_description":"张九龄，字子寿，一名博物，韶州曲江人（今广东省韶关市曲江区）。唐代第一位由岭南书生进身的宰相、诗人。卒谥文献。人称“张曲江”。有《张曲江集》。","link_td_id":"Q10002171","link_td_number_id":72688,"people_name":"九齡","people_name_jianti_auto":"九龄","people_xingming":"张九龄","start_index":151,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4886-db0e-11ef-b81b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"皋陶，偃姓，是舜帝和夏朝初期的一位贤臣。传说中生于尧帝统治的时候，曾经被舜任命为掌管刑法的「理官」，以正直闻名天下，被奉为中国司法鼻祖。","link_td_id":"Q10001087","link_td_number_id":514706,"people_name":"咎繇","people_name_jianti_auto":"咎繇","people_xingming":"皋陶","start_index":221,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4887-db0e-11ef-be34-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[皋陶]"},{"link_birth_year":-505,"link_death_year":-432,"link_td_description":"曾子，春秋末期鲁国南武城（山东嘉祥县）人，儒家主要代表人物之一，孔子的弟子，世称“曾子”，有“宗圣”之称。","link_td_id":"Q10002146","link_td_number_id":113662,"people_name":"曾參","people_name_jianti_auto":"曾参","people_xingming":"曾参","start_index":231,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4888-db0e-11ef-bab3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"萬頃","people_name_jianti_auto":"万顷","start_index":277,"tongjian_id":"bd0f488a-db0e-11ef-9d19-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"bd0f486d-db0e-11ef-a6a5-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"lěi","source_anchor_text":"之為作哀誄牓於衢路","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":259,"text":"誄","tongjian_id":"4f3a03a3-b6f0-5d8a-ba7d-cf4523cadfe6"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"嶺","place_name_jianti_auto":"岭","resolved_place_entity_id":326,"start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"bd0f487e-db0e-11ef-8715-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"江外","place_name_jianti_auto":"江外","resolved_place_entity_id":65,"start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4881-db0e-11ef-928e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汜水","place_name_jianti_auto":"汜水","place_note":"流经河南省荥阳市北","resolved_place_entity_id":1191,"start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4882-db0e-11ef-a557-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河南府","place_name_jianti_auto":"河南府","resolved_place_entity_id":176,"start_index":243,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4889-db0e-11ef-aa0c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北邙","place_name_jianti_auto":"北邙","place_note":"洛阳城北","resolved_place_entity_id":1457,"start_index":273,"tongjian_id":"bd0f488b-db0e-11ef-baa3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"3初，殿中侍御史楊汪旣殺張審素，更名萬頃。審素二子瑝、琇皆幼，坐流嶺表；尋逃歸，謀伺便復讎。三月，丁卯，手殺萬頃於都城，繫表於斧，言父冤狀；欲之江外殺與萬頃同謀陷其父者，至汜水，爲有司所得。議者多言二子父死非罪，穉年孝烈能復父讎，宜加矜宥，張九齡亦欲活之。裴耀卿、李林甫以爲如此，壞國法，上亦以爲然，謂九齡曰：「孝子之情，義不顧死，然殺人而赦之，此塗不可啓也。」乃下敕曰：「國家設法，期於止殺。各伸爲子之志，誰非徇孝之人！展轉相讎，何有限極！咎繇作士，法在必行。曾參殺人，亦不可恕。宜付河南府杖殺。」士民皆憐之，爲作哀誄，牓於衢路。市人斂錢葬之於北邙，恐萬頃家發之，仍爲疑冢數處。","content_fanyi":"起初，殿中侍御史杨汪在杀死张审素以后，改名为杨万顷。张审素的两个儿子张瑝、张琇都还年幼，受连累被流放到岭南；不久逃回来，谋划伺机报仇。三月十一日丁卯，他们在都城亲手杀了杨万顷，把表章系在斧头上，陈述他们父亲蒙冤的情况；他们想前往江外杀掉与杨万顷同谋陷害他们父亲的人，行至汜水，被有关部门捕获。议论的人大都说这两个儿子的父亲无罪而被处死，他们年幼而孝烈，能够为父报仇，应当加以怜悯宽宥；张九龄也想救他们。裴耀卿、李林甫认为这样做会破坏国法，唐玄宗也这样认为，并对张九龄说：“孝子的感情，为了义可以不顾性命；然而杀了人却加以赦免，这样的先例不可开。”于是下敕令说：“国家设立法度，目的在于制止凶杀。人人都要申明自己做儿子的心志，谁不是遵行孝道的人！这样辗转互相报仇，哪里会有穷尽！咎繇担任虞舜时的法官，法度必须执行。即使是曾参杀了人，也不能宽恕。应当交付河南府杖杀。”士人和百姓都怜悯这两个孝子，为他们撰写哀诔，张贴在交通要道。市民们募集钱财，将他们安葬在北邙山；担心杨万顷的家人掘坟，又设了好几处疑冢。","content_jianti_auto":"3初，殿中侍御史杨汪既杀张审素，更名万顷。审素二子瑝、琇皆幼，坐流岭表；寻逃归，谋伺便复雠。三月，丁卯，手杀万顷于都城，系表于斧，言父冤状；欲之江外杀与万顷同谋陷其父者，至汜水，为有司所得。议者多言二子父死非罪，穉年孝烈能复父雠，宜加矜宥，张九龄亦欲活之。裴耀卿、李林甫以为如此，坏国法，上亦以为然，谓九龄曰：「孝子之情，义不顾死，然杀人而赦之，此涂不可启也。」乃下敕曰：「国家设法，期于止杀。各伸为子之志，谁非徇孝之人！展转相雠，何有限极！咎繇作士，法在必行。曾参杀人，亦不可恕。宜付河南府杖杀。」士民皆怜之，为作哀诔，牓于衢路。市人敛钱葬之于北邙，恐万顷家发之，仍为疑冢数处。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21550,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"bd0f486d-db0e-11ef-a6a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"咸宜公主","people_name_jianti_auto":"咸宜公主","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd0f488f-db0e-11ef-aa02-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"楊洄","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨洄","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4890-db0e-11ef-8e13-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"咸宜公主下嫁楊洄。","note_content_jianti_auto":"咸宜公主下嫁杨洄。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":156,"tongjian_id":"bd0f488e-db0e-11ef-b634-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"三品員外官","official_note":"三品員外官是唐代的一种官职，通常指正三品的员外郎，属于高级官员，但可能不担任实际职务。在上下文中，它用于描述駙馬（公主的丈夫）被授予此官衔，但不参与具体政务，反映了唐代对皇室姻亲的优待政策。此信息基于《资治通鉴》原文和历史常识。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"駙馬皆除三品員外官","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"080bc2e3-4fa7-4b95-8566-85de9fc65971"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":656,"link_death_year":710,"link_td_description":"唐中宗李显，原名李哲，是唐朝皇帝，两次在位：第一次在位时间为684年1月3日－684年2月26日，第二次在位时间为705年2月23日－710年7月3日，两次在位合共五年半。唐中宗公元710年病逝，终年55岁，谥号大和大圣大昭孝皇帝（初谥孝和皇帝），葬于定陵。","link_td_id":"Q10000146","link_td_number_id":23557,"people_name":"中宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"中宗","people_xingming":"李显","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4891-db0e-11ef-bf0e-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[李显]"},{"link_birth_year":665,"link_death_year":713,"link_td_description":"太平公主，封号“镇国太平公主”，唐朝皇室成员、政治家、权臣，是唐高宗李治与武则天的小女儿，唐中宗和唐睿宗的妹妹，也是安定思公主的妹妹，唐玄宗的姑母。","link_td_id":"Q10008198","link_td_number_id":134595,"people_name":"太平公主","people_name_jianti_auto":"太平公主","people_xingming":"太平公主","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4892-db0e-11ef-a6c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":784,"link_td_description":"咸宜公主唐朝公主，是中国唐朝皇帝唐玄宗李隆基的女儿，母武惠妃。","link_td_id":"Q10013363","link_td_number_id":1593159,"people_name":"咸宜公主","people_name_jianti_auto":"咸宜公主","people_xingming":"咸宜公主","start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4894-db0e-11ef-8546-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":699,"link_death_year":737,"link_td_description":"贞顺皇后，即唐玄宗的宠妃——武惠妃，父恒安王武攸止，母郑国夫人杨氏。她是武则天的堂侄孙女，婶娘太平公主。","link_td_id":"Q10000482","link_td_number_id":251700,"people_name":"武惠妃","people_name_jianti_auto":"武惠妃","people_xingming":"武惠妃","start_index":167,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4895-db0e-11ef-a5a3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","resolved_place_entity_id":44,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4893-db0e-11ef-be32-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4唐初，公主實封止三百戶，中宗時，太平公主至五千戶，率以七丁爲限。開元以來，皇妹止千戶，皇女又半之，皆以三丁爲限；駙馬皆除三品員外官，而不任以職事。公主邑入至少，至不能具車服，左右或言其太薄，上曰：「百姓租賦，非我所有。戰士出死力，賞不過束帛；女子何功，而享多戶邪？且欲使之知儉嗇耳。」秋，七月，咸宜公主將下嫁，始加實封至千戶。公主，武惠妃之女也。於是諸公主皆加至千戶。","content_fanyi":"唐朝初年，公主的实封食邑只有三百户；中宗时，太平公主的封户达到五千户，大致以七丁为限。开元以来，皇帝的妹妹只封一千户，皇帝的女儿又减半，都以三丁为限；驸马都授三品员外官，而不担任实际职务。公主封邑的收入太少，以致无法备办车马服饰，玄宗身边的人有的说封邑太少，玄宗说：“百姓的租赋，并不归我私有。战士拼死效力，赏赐也不过束帛；女子有什么功劳，却享有这么多封户呢？同时也是想让她们懂得节俭啊。”秋季七月，咸宜公主将要下嫁，才加实封至一千户。咸宜公主是武惠妃的女儿。于是诸公主都加至一千户。","content_jianti_auto":"4唐初，公主实封止三百户，中宗时，太平公主至五千户，率以七丁为限。开元以来，皇妹止千户，皇女又半之，皆以三丁为限；驸马皆除三品员外官，而不任以职事。公主邑入至少，至不能具车服，左右或言其太薄，上曰：「百姓租赋，非我所有。战士出死力，赏不过束帛；女子何功，而享多户邪？且欲使之知俭啬耳。」秋，七月，咸宜公主将下嫁，始加实封至千户。公主，武惠妃之女也。于是诸公主皆加至千户。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21551,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"bd0f488c-db0e-11ef-8705-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"突騎施","place_name_jianti_auto":"突骑施","place_note":"伊犁河中下游","resolved_place_entity_id":912,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4898-db0e-11ef-ad76-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北庭","place_name_jianti_auto":"北庭","place_note":"新疆吉木萨尔县","resolved_place_entity_id":636,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4899-db0e-11ef-83b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安西","place_name_jianti_auto":"安西","place_note":"设龟兹，新疆库车","resolved_place_entity_id":505,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"bd0f489a-db0e-11ef-847b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"撥換城","place_name_jianti_auto":"拨换城","resolved_place_entity_id":3769,"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"bd0f489b-db0e-11ef-a078-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"5冬，十月，戊申，突騎施寇北庭及安西撥換城。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月二十六日戊申，突骑施进犯北庭及安西拨换城。","content_jianti_auto":"5冬，十月，戊申，突骑施寇北庭及安西拨换城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21552,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bd0f4896-db0e-11ef-9764-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：舊紀作「十一月，壬申朔」。按長曆，十一月壬子朔。今從實錄、唐曆。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：旧纪作「十一月，壬申朔」。按长历，十一月壬子朔。今从实录、唐历。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd0f489d-db0e-11ef-a67f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6閏月，壬午朔，日有食之。","content_fanyi":"闰十一月初一壬午朔，发生日食。","content_jianti_auto":"6闰月，壬午朔，日有食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21553,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"bd0f489c-db0e-11ef-802a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"玄璬","people_name_jianti_auto":"玄璬","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48a5-db0e-11ef-899c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳鴻","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈鸿","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48a6-db0e-11ef-89df-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高力士","people_name_jianti_auto":"高力士","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48a7-db0e-11ef-87fa-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"楊玄琰","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨玄琰","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48a8-db0e-11ef-9734-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"寿","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48a9-db0e-11ef-83d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"玄琰","people_name_jianti_auto":"玄琰","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48aa-db0e-11ef-9908-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"玄璬","people_name_jianti_auto":"玄璬","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48ab-db0e-11ef-af2c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"玄琰","people_name_jianti_auto":"玄琰","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48ac-db0e-11ef-8258-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太眞","people_name_jianti_auto":"太真","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48ad-db0e-11ef-8bf6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"壽王","people_name_jianti_auto":"寿王","start_index":121,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48ae-db0e-11ef-88ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太眞","people_name_jianti_auto":"太真","start_index":147,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48af-db0e-11ef-90fa-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"壽王","people_name_jianti_auto":"寿王","start_index":152,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48b0-db0e-11ef-9e18-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韋昭訓","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦昭训","start_index":155,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48b1-db0e-11ef-b467-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太眞","people_name_jianti_auto":"太真","start_index":161,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48b2-db0e-11ef-86ba-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲帝納妃於後宮以亂國張本。考異曰：實錄載冊文，云「玄璬長女」。按陳鴻長恨歌傳云：「詔高力士潛搜外宮，得楊玄琰女於壽邸。」舊·楊貴妃傳云：「玄琰女早孤，養於叔父玄璬。」又云：「或奏玄琰女容色冠代，宜蒙召見。時妃衣道士服，號太眞。」新傳云：「始爲壽王妃云云，遂召內禁中，卽爲自出妃意者，匄籍女官，號太眞，更爲壽王娶韋昭訓女，而太眞得幸。」舊史蓋諱之耳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为帝纳妃于后宫以乱国张本。考异曰：实录载册文，云「玄璬长女」。按陈鸿长恨歌传云：「诏高力士潜搜外宫，得杨玄琰女于寿邸。」旧·杨贵妃传云：「玄琰女早孤，养于叔父玄璬。」又云：「或奏玄琰女容色冠代，宜蒙召见。时妃衣道士服，号太真。」新传云：「始为寿王妃云云，遂召内禁中，即为自出妃意者，匄籍女官，号太真，更为寿王娶韦昭训女，而太真得幸。」旧史盖讳之耳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48a4-db0e-11ef-86f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":17,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"楊汪見一百八十三卷隋煬帝大業十二年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b5cad038-db0e-11ef-b5a8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"楊汪","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨汪","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48ba-db0e-11ef-9f5b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隋煬帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"隋炀帝","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48bb-db0e-11ef-8531-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"楊汪見一百八十三卷隋煬帝大業十二年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"杨汪见一百八十三卷隋炀帝大业十二年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48b9-db0e-11ef-bf0d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"司戶","official_note":"司戶是唐代地方州府的官职，负责户籍、赋税等民政事务，此处指杨玄琰曾任蜀州司戶，用于说明其身份背景。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"蜀州司戶","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a900ade0-d9ae-48d3-b06a-cf951cb7c024"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"楊玄琰","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨玄琰","people_xingming":"杨玄琰","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48bc-db0e-11ef-bbcb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"壽王","people_name_jianti_auto":"寿王","people_xingming":"李清","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48bd-db0e-11ef-814f-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[李清]"},{"people_name":"玄琰","people_name_jianti_auto":"玄琰","people_xingming":"杨玄琰","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48bf-db0e-11ef-8a75-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":621,"link_td_description":"杨汪，字元度，弘农郡华阴县人，北周、隋朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10007918","link_td_number_id":6757919,"people_name":"汪","people_name_jianti_auto":"汪","people_xingming":"杨汪","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48c0-db0e-11ef-aca0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蜀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀州","place_note":"四川崇州市","resolved_place_entity_id":1771,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48be-db0e-11ef-bbfd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"7十二月，乙亥，冊故蜀州司戶楊玄琰女爲壽王妃。玄琰，汪之曾孫也。","content_fanyi":"十二月二十四日乙亥，册立原蜀州司户杨玄琰的女儿为寿王李清的王妃。杨玄琰，是隋朝国子祭酒杨汪的曾孙。","content_jianti_auto":"7十二月，乙亥，册故蜀州司户杨玄琰女为寿王妃。玄琰，汪之曾孙也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21554,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48a3-db0e-11ef-b360-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"過折","people_name_jianti_auto":"过折","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48c3-db0e-11ef-a395-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"可突干","people_name_jianti_auto":"可突干","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48c4-db0e-11ef-a7a6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"泥裏","people_name_jianti_auto":"泥里","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48c5-db0e-11ef-9c4c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"泥裏","people_name_jianti_auto":"泥里","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48c6-db0e-11ef-bb71-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張九齡","people_name_jianti_auto":"张九龄","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48c7-db0e-11ef-ad19-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"涅禮","people_name_jianti_auto":"涅礼","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48c8-db0e-11ef-999d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"泥裏","people_name_jianti_auto":"泥里","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48c9-db0e-11ef-be24-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"涅禮","people_name_jianti_auto":"涅礼","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48ca-db0e-11ef-bf10-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"涅，奴結翻。考異曰：舊傳，過折爲可突干餘黨泥裏所殺，不云朝廷如何處置泥裏。今據張九齡集有此賜契丹都督涅禮敕，又有賜張守珪敕云：「涅禮自擅，難以義責，而未有名位，恐其不安，卿可宣示朝旨，使知無他也。」蓋泥裏卽涅禮也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"涅，奴结翻。考异曰：旧传，过折为可突干余党泥里所杀，不云朝廷如何处置泥里。今据张九龄集有此赐契丹都督涅礼敕，又有赐张守珪敕云：「涅礼自擅，难以义责，而未有名位，恐其不安，卿可宣示朝旨，使知无他也。」盖泥里即涅礼也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48c2-db0e-11ef-8faa-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"安東都護府","place_name_jianti_auto":"安东都护府","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48d1-db0e-11ef-9bcb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平州","place_name_jianti_auto":"平州","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48d2-db0e-11ef-b84e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"剌，盧達翻。乾，音干。開元二年移安東都護府於平州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"剌，卢达翻。干，音干。开元二年移安东都护府于平州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"bd0f48d0-db0e-11ef-b3a5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"松漠都督","official_note":"松漠都督是唐朝在契丹地区设置的羁縻都督府官职，用于管理契丹部落，此处表示涅礼被任命为松漠都督以安抚契丹。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"因以涅禮爲松漠都督","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"590a5728-ce61-45bc-a0c5-f6578c2d4e19"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"奚王","official_note":"奚王是奚族部落的首领称号，唐朝常授予羁縻官职以管理奚族，此处表示奚王李归国参与军事行动。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"奚王李歸國","start_index":155,"tongjian_id":"1b5b20b1-3904-4935-afa6-592da0cc3590"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":735,"link_td_description":"李过折，又作遇折、郁捷、李遇折，唐代契丹部落联盟首领。","link_td_id":"Q10010454","link_td_number_